## 1. Original Academic Text, Documentation, and Scientific Diagrams

All original literature review writing, synthesis documentation (`docs/`), scientific figures/diagrams (`diagrams/`, `assets/`), and extraction ledgers (`data/`) authored by Snigdha Gorai are licensed under the:

**Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0)**

You are free to:
- **Share** — copy and redistribute the material in any medium or format.
- **Adapt** — remix, transform, and build upon the material for any purpose, even commercially.

Under the following terms:
- **Attribution** — You must give appropriate credit (citing Snigdha Gorai, VIT-AP University, and linking to this repository), provide a link to the license, and indicate if changes were made.

To view a copy of this license, visit [https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

