- **Third-Party Research Papers:** All cited research publications, conference papers, preprints, and associated datasets cited or referenced in this repository remain the intellectual property and copyright of their respective authors and publishers (including IEEE, CVF, ACM, PMLR, AAAI, and arXiv).
- **No Redistribution of Copyrighted PDFs:** This public repository **does not host or redistribute third-party copyrighted full-text PDF files**. Links to the authoritative publisher DOIs and open-access repositories are provided in [`docs/references.md`](docs/references.md) and [`references/bibliography.bib`](references/bibliography.bib).
